# November 19, 2026: Madison County, New York (Peterboro, Cazenovia, Chittenango, Canastota, Oneida, Morrisville,
# Hamilton, Bouckville, DeRuyter, Georgetown, Nelson, Fenner, Clockville). Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny
# (region cny, which offered Peterboro); the Atlas had one place within 20 km of Peterboro (the Chittenango Landing dry
# docks). Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py, including the Madison County Register
# list), HMdb marker pages (tools/page.py), the Gerrit Smith Estate, National Abolition Hall of Fame, Oneida Community
# Mansion House, Madison County Historical Society, Chenango Canal Association, Tromptown Historical Society and Village
# of Canastota pages, the State Parks page for Lorenzo, the DEC page for Muller Hill State Forest, the Spirit House
# Register form (NPGallery), courthouses.co, a 2020 local-history blog on the old courthouse and the Route 20
# Association's Madison Hall page.
